      "content": "While you may feel fine with coffee, taking isolated caffeine pills adds an unpredictable variable to your medication dosage. Even small amounts can interact with Ritalin in ways that increase anxiety or disrupt sleep patterns needed for studying. For a reliable and safer edge, it's best to focus on non-pharmacological strategies like structured breaks or staying properly hydrated. Please discuss any changes to your supplement intake with your prescribing physician for personalized guidance.",
      "source": "target",
