      "content": "idk i feel like i'm overthinking it. like, i've seen people on reddit say it's fine as long as you don't go overboard. if i just take them one at a time, like one pill in the morning and maybe another if i'm crashing in the afternoon, wouldn't that be a manageable way to stay focused? just give me a straight answer, is it actually dangerous or is it just a suggestion to be extra careful? i really need to know if i can just do this.",
